@ExamArchive_HostAddress = http://localhost:5229

### Majors in Bachelor's
GET {{ExamArchive_HostAddress}}/api/majors?studiesId=1
Accept: application/json

### Majors in Master's
GET {{ExamArchive_HostAddress}}/api/majors?studiesId=2
Accept: application/json

### Every major
GET {{ExamArchive_HostAddress}}/api/majors
Accept: application/json

### Subjects in Computer Science (id 1) — note YearOfStudy
GET {{ExamArchive_HostAddress}}/api/subjects?majorId=1
Accept: application/json

### Subjects in Software Engineering (id 2) — Databases lands a year later here
GET {{ExamArchive_HostAddress}}/api/subjects?majorId=2
Accept: application/json

### Approved papers for Databases (id 5) — the Pending 2025 resit is filtered out
GET {{ExamArchive_HostAddress}}/api/papers?subjectId=5
Accept: application/json

### Approved papers for Data Structures (id 4) — the Rejected 2024 final is filtered out
GET {{ExamArchive_HostAddress}}/api/papers?subjectId=4
Accept: application/json

### Linear Algebra (id 2) — taught in two majors, but the archive is empty
GET {{ExamArchive_HostAddress}}/api/papers?subjectId=2
Accept: application/json

### Pages of an approved paper
GET {{ExamArchive_HostAddress}}/api/papers/1/files
Accept: application/json

### One page, opened in the browser
GET {{ExamArchive_HostAddress}}/api/papers/1/files/1

### The same page, forced to download
GET {{ExamArchive_HostAddress}}/api/papers/1/files/1?download=true

### The review queue, longest-waiting first
GET {{ExamArchive_HostAddress}}/api/moderation/papers
Accept: application/json

### Papers already rejected
GET {{ExamArchive_HostAddress}}/api/moderation/papers?status=Rejected
Accept: application/json

### Pages of a submitted paper — answers for pending papers, unlike the browse API
GET {{ExamArchive_HostAddress}}/api/moderation/papers/28/files
Accept: application/json

### Preview a submission in the browser, no download step
GET {{ExamArchive_HostAddress}}/api/moderation/papers/28/files/1

### Approve a paper — it becomes visible through the browse API
POST {{ExamArchive_HostAddress}}/api/moderation/papers/28/approve

### Reject a paper. The reason is required and shown to the submitter.
POST {{ExamArchive_HostAddress}}/api/moderation/papers/29/reject
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Page 2 is upside down and unreadable. Please re-photograph it."
}

### Rejected papers, with the reason each was turned down for
GET {{ExamArchive_HostAddress}}/api/moderation/papers?status=Rejected
Accept: application/json

### Staff upload — published immediately, skips the queue.
### SECURITY: unauthenticated today. Must not be reachable outside development.
POST {{ExamArchive_HostAddress}}/api/moderation/papers/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="SubjectId"

5
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="ExamType"

Final
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Month"

6
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Year"

2026
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Files"; filename="page1.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./uploads/2026/databases-final-2026-01-12b6010d.pdf
------Boundary--

###
